OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny evening
OL,6,Fbrightness will gradually be replaced
OL,7,Fby cloudy skies overnight. A few spots
OL,8,Fof rain then developing by dawn,
OL,9,Fmainly over northern hills. Another
OL,10,Frather mild night ahead with light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA cloudy Monday with outbreaks
OL,14,Fof light patchy rain. Drier through
OL,15,Fthe evening before being replaced by
OL,16,Fheavy and persistent rain pushing
OL,17,Fsouth overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
